[00:18.84]The living God, Jehovah, you have proved to be;
[00:28.02]Your mighty works abound
[00:32.08]in earth and sky and sea.
[00:37.48]No rival god can equal what you have done
[00:44.78]—there is none.
[00:48.00]Our foes will be consumed.
[00:56.35](Chorus)
[00:56.50]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[01:06.09]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[01:15.37]So with courage and faith in our God,
[01:21.49]we spread the fame
[01:24.63]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[01:30.91]and praise his name.
[01:51.89]Though ropes of death encircle me, I call to you,
[01:59.49]“Jehovah, give me strength,
[02:05.79]and give me courage too.”
[02:10.51]From your own temple dwelling, you hear my plea,
[02:17.76]“Shelter me;
[02:21.93]Rescue me, O my God.”
[02:28.87](Chorus)
[02:29.02]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[02:39.05]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[02:48.35]So with courage and faith in our God,
[02:54.45]we spread the fame
[02:57.59]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[03:03.81]and praise his name.
[03:16.21]From heaven you will thunder
[03:31.71]and give forth your voice.
[03:36.79]Your enemies will quake;
[03:41.55]your servants will rejoice.
[03:46.13]You prove to be whatever you need to be;
[03:53.91]all will see
[03:55.75]How you provide escape.
[04:05.28](Chorus)
[04:05.43]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[04:15.69]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[04:25.19]So with courage and faith in our God,
[04:31.73]we spread the fame
[04:35.01]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[04:41.35]and praise his name.
